# Working memory. A capability's plan and worklists live in .work/<slug>/ and ARE
# committed — a PR shows the cut it landed on. What sits directly in .work/ is
# per-tree scratch: review report, review prompt, status. By shape, not by name:
# a denylist of scratch filenames breaks the day the kit adds one.
# Doctrine: rules/product/documents.md.
